    'Council member'::text,
    'Chad West'::text,
    'Chad West represents Dallas District 1 and first won the seat in 2019. Raised in southern Illinois, he attended Washington University in St. Louis, served as a U.S. Army officer, and later graduated with honors from Texas Tech University''s law school. In Dallas, he established a law practice and developed car-wash businesses. Before joining the council, he served on the City Plan Commission in 2017–2018. His council work has included housing, walkability, neighborhood planning, and parks and trails.'::text,
    'https://dallascityhall.com/government/citycouncil/district1/Pages/council-member.aspx'::text,
    'https://dallascityhall.com/government/citycouncil/PublishingImages/Members/District%201.jpg'::text,
