    'District 1'::text,
    'District 1 serves North Oak Cliff. Its neighborhood infrastructure priorities include the Jefferson Boulevard corridor, Elmwood streets and parkway, and parks such as Stevens Park and Westmoreland Park. These examples describe parts of the district rather than its complete legal boundary.'::text,
