    'City of Dallas'::text,
    'City Council'::text,
    'Council member'::text,
    'Jesse Moreno'::text,
    'Jesse Moreno represents Dallas District 2, where he grew up and has longstanding family ties. He first won a council seat in June 2021. Before that election, he spent more than seven years on the Dallas Park Board and volunteered with neighborhood schools and community organizations. His official biography emphasizes constituent service, accountability, and transparency.'::text,
    'https://dallascityhall.com/government/citycouncil/district2/Pages/council-member.aspx'::text,
    'https://dallascityhall.com/government/citycouncil/district2/PublishingImages/Pages/default/Jesse-Moreno-profile.jpg'::text,
    '[{"label":"Council Member Jesse Moreno","email":"jesse.moreno@dallas.gov","when_to_use":"Contact the council member about District 2 representation, policy, or council business."},{"label":"Priscilla Chambliss — District Director","email":"priscilla.chambliss@dallas.gov","when_to_use":"District office assistance and coordination of neighborhood or constituent concerns."},{"label":"Evelyn Amaya — Council Liaison","email":"evelyn.amaya@dallascityhall.com","when_to_use":"Constituent assistance and council office liaison matters."}]'::jsonb,
