    'District 2'::text,
    'District 2 connects Dallas neighborhoods with active commercial and event corridors. Its district bond program includes street-grid improvements linking Deep Ellum and Fair Park, alongside local street, alley, and sidewalk work. This is a descriptive overview, not an exhaustive neighborhood list or legal boundary definition.'::text,
