    'District 3'::text,
    'District 3 serves communities in Oak Cliff and southwest Dallas. Its district infrastructure program reaches corridors such as Red Bird Lane and Mountain Creek Parkway and includes Kiest Valley-area streets, Big Cedar Wilderness, and Mountain Valley Park. These examples are not a complete statement of district boundaries.'::text,
