    'District 4'::text,
    'District 4 includes Oak Cliff neighborhoods and community facilities around Cedar Crest and Kiest Park. Its district bond program includes neighborhood streets, Cedar Crest Golf Course improvements, and work at Kiest Park and Kiest Recreation Center. This overview is not a substitute for the adopted district boundary map.'::text,
