    'District 5'::text,
    'District 5 serves southeast Dallas communities associated with Pleasant Grove. Its district infrastructure program includes the Lake June Road area and improvements along Military Parkway between Forney Road and Buckner Boulevard, together with neighborhood street and alley projects. The adopted district map, rather than this summary, determines individual address eligibility.'::text,
