    'City of Dallas'::text,
    'City Council'::text,
    'Council member'::text,
    'Laura Cadena'::text,
    'Laura Cadena represents District 6, where she grew up and previously served for nearly eight years as the council office''s chief of staff. She earned a Bachelor of Arts and a Master of Divinity from Baylor University. Her civic work has included neighborhood planning, bond-project coordination, emergency response, tree planting and recognition of Dallas''s Koreatown. She was elected on May 3, 2025.'::text,
    'https://dallascityhall.com/government/citycouncil/district6/Pages/default.aspx'::text,
