    'Council member'::text,
    'Adam Bazaldua'::text,
    'Adam Bazaldua grew up in DeSoto and worked as a chef in New York and Dallas before becoming a Dallas ISD teacher. First elected to District 7 in 2019, he has worked on library access, mobile food businesses, short-term rentals and funding for Fair Park. His public-service experience includes leadership roles with the National League of Cities and service as Dallas deputy mayor pro tem in 2024-2025.'::text,
