    'City of Dallas'::text,
    'City Council'::text,
    'Council member'::text,
    'Lorie Blair'::text,
    'Lorie Blair represents District 8 in southern Dallas. She served on the City Plan Commission from 2020 to 2024 and spent 35 years at AT&T, advancing from customer service to information-technology project management. She also reported on local civic issues for Elite News and trained as a civil court mediator at El Centro College. Her community and planning work has addressed housing, infrastructure and development in areas including Kleberg-Rylie and the inland port.'::text,
    'https://dallascityhall.com/government/citycouncil/district8/Pages/default.aspx'::text,
    'https://dallascityhall.com/government/PublishingImages/Lorie-Blair.jpg'::text,
