    'District 8'::text,
    'District 8 covers varied communities in southern Dallas, from residential and urban corridors to the more rural Kleberg-Rylie area. Its development context includes the International Inland Port of Dallas and areas near UNT Dallas and Paul Quinn College.'::text,
