    'Council member'::text,
    'Paula Blackmon'::text,
    'Paula Blackmon represents District 9 in East Dallas. Raised in Snyder, Texas, she earned a degree in international economics from Texas Tech University. She previously worked in senior staff roles for Dallas mayors Tom Leppert and Mike Rawlings and advised Dallas ISD superintendent Mike Miles. Her council work has included environmental planning, White Rock Lake dredging funding, residential permitting and initiatives addressing fentanyl and access to menstrual products.'::text,
