    'City of Dallas'::text,
    'City Council'::text,
    'Council member'::text,
    'Kathy Stewart'::text,
    'Kathy Stewart represents District 10, including Lake Highlands and Hamilton Park, and was first elected in 2023. An attorney, she has served as executive director of the Lake Highlands Public Improvement District, president of the White Rock Valley Neighborhood Association and PTA president at three area schools. She also helped own and operate Highlands Cafe with other Lake Highlands families for a decade.'::text,
    'https://dallascityhall.com/government/citycouncil/district10/Pages/default.aspx'::text,
    'https://dallascityhall.com/government/citycouncil/district10/PublishingImages/pages/default/3953.jpg'::text,
