    'City of Dallas'::text,
    'City Council'::text,
    'Council member'::text,
    'Bill Roth'::text,
    'Bill Roth, identified as William Roth on the city''s council roster, represents District 11. His official biography describes more than four decades living in North Dallas, where he raised his family and developed The William Roth Company. He earned his undergraduate degree at George Washington University and his law degree at Southern Methodist University. His community involvement includes leadership at Jewish Family Service and its foundation, service to local congregations, and participation on Dallas''s Housing Finance Corporation board and Forward Dallas Advisory Committee.'::text,
    'https://dallascityhall.com/government/citycouncil/district11/Pages/default.aspx'::text,
