    'District 11'::text,
    'District 11 spans North Dallas neighborhoods on both sides of Interstate 635. The adopted map includes areas around Spring Valley Road and Belt Line Road to the north and the Hillcrest Road, Forest Lane and Royal Lane corridors farther south, with portions adjoining US 75.'::text,
