    'City of Dallas'::text,
    'City Council'::text,
    'Council member'::text,
    'Cara Mendelsohn'::text,
    'Cara Mendelsohn represents District 12 in Far North Dallas and first joined the council after the May 2019 election. Before public office, she worked in nonprofit leadership, including as executive director of Rebuilding Together North Texas, and held board roles with organizations addressing hunger, homelessness and family needs. She previously worked in human resources in banking and insurance. Her Dallas volunteer service included homelessness initiatives and the 2017 bond process. She earned a business administration degree from the University of Texas at Austin.'::text,
