    'District 12'::text,
    'District 12 serves Far North Dallas. Its adopted map extends across neighborhoods along the Dallas North Tollway, Preston Road and Hillcrest Road, reaching toward the Frankford Road and President George Bush Turnpike corridors. The district''s southern edge is irregular rather than following a single east-west road.'::text,
