    'Council member'::text,
    'Gay Donnell Willis'::text,
    'Gay Donnell Willis represents District 13, and the city''s biography identifies her as serving a third council term. Her professional background combines advertising, television promotions and nonprofit management. She led the Turtle Creek Conservancy for nine years, working on park improvements, fundraising and the connection between Turtle Creek Park and the Katy Trail. Her prior public service included Dallas''s Community Development Commission, the Vickery Meadow tax-increment financing board and bond committees. She is a Texas Tech University graduate and a Certified Fund Raising Executive, with additional leadership experience in the Junior League of Dallas.'::text,
