  -- Note: The main district page calls Apryl Davis a community engagement coordinator, while the biography sidebar calls her a council assistant. The email and phone are those published in the official sidebar; a neutral staff label avoids choosing between the titles.
  -- Note: The d14dallas Facebook URL is explicitly linked by the official District 14 page, but direct retrieval returned only a generic Facebook title. The three ridleyfordallas profiles are campaign-linked and their page titles corroborate Paul Ridley's identity. No LinkedIn or Bluesky account was verified.
