    'District 14'::text,
    'District 14 covers parts of central and East Dallas on both sides of US 75. The adopted map includes areas around Turtle Creek, Oak Lawn Avenue, Ross Avenue and Greenville Avenue, with a northern reach toward Mockingbird Lane and an irregular eastern boundary through East Dallas.'::text,
